5. The remaining drones were originally assigned to various fields. To decide which of the remaining five to allocate to Field_2, we computed their approximate distances to Field_2’s center (using Field_2’s coordinates: left 6, right 22, top 30, bottom 45; center roughly (14,37.5)). In order of closeness, we got:
